---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: What's next
eyebrow: Roadmap
subtitle: What's being worked on, what's waiting its turn, and where the project is heading in general.
permalink: /roadmap/
---
<div class="lead" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
  This page is a rough guide, not a promise. The <strong>soon</strong> column is what I'm actively working on for the next release. The <strong>later</strong> column is what I know I want to do but haven't started. The <strong>someday</strong> column is a direction, not a commitment — some of those might never happen, and others might shift earlier if they start to matter.
</div>

<div class="roadmap-grid">
  <div class="roadmap-col">
    <h3 class="roadmap-col__title">{{ roadmap.nearTerm.title }}</h3>
    <p class="roadmap-col__subtitle">{{ roadmap.nearTerm.subtitle }}</p>
    <ul class="roadmap-col__list">
      {% for item in roadmap.nearTerm.items %}
      <li class="roadmap-col__item">
        <span class="roadmap-col__label">{{ item.label }}{% if item.quarter %} <span class="roadmap-col__quarter">{{ item.quarter }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
        <p class="roadmap-col__note">{{ item.note }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="roadmap-col">
    <h3 class="roadmap-col__title">{{ roadmap.mediumTerm.title }}</h3>
    <p class="roadmap-col__subtitle">{{ roadmap.mediumTerm.subtitle }}</p>
    <ul class="roadmap-col__list">
      {% for item in roadmap.mediumTerm.items %}
      <li class="roadmap-col__item">
        <span class="roadmap-col__label">{{ item.label }}{% if item.quarter %} <span class="roadmap-col__quarter">{{ item.quarter }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
        <p class="roadmap-col__note">{{ item.note }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="roadmap-col">
    <h3 class="roadmap-col__title">{{ roadmap.longTerm.title }}</h3>
    <p class="roadmap-col__subtitle">{{ roadmap.longTerm.subtitle }}</p>
    <ul class="roadmap-col__list">
      {% for item in roadmap.longTerm.items %}
      <li class="roadmap-col__item">
        <span class="roadmap-col__label">{{ item.label }}{% if item.quarter %} <span class="roadmap-col__quarter">{{ item.quarter }}</span>{% endif %}</span>
        <p class="roadmap-col__note">{{ item.note }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="callout" style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">
  <div class="callout__title">Got an idea?</div>
  <p>Open a discussion on <a href="{{ meta.github }}/discussions">GitHub</a> or <a href="/forms/feature-request/">send it through the form</a>. I read every one.</p>
</div>
